  '<h3 class="gd-h3">Who this guide is for</h3><p class="gd-p">CarmaCars staff in Customer service, Finance, Fleet and Sales, in the office, remote or in person. Everyone works in one staff portal: its menu shows a group for each function you hold. Read chapter 1, then the chapter for each of your functions. If you also do field work (handovers, returns, moving cars), read the Field Guide too: your jobs are under <b class="gd-ui">Field work</b> in the same menu.</p><h3 class="gd-h3">What you need</h3><ul class="gd-ul"><li>The invitation email from CarmaCars (the link works for 24 hours)</li><li>A computer for your shift. The portal also works on a phone</li><li>An authenticator app on your phone, if your Admin turns on two-step sign-in</li></ul><section class="gd-task" id="start-here-once-you-are-hired" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Once you are hired</h2><p class="gd-p">You are not working a shift right away. First your training (the academy), then you claim your shifts online in the portal.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Say hello in the team chat: the CarmaCars Team WhatsApp group (the link is in your portal once the academy and your agreement are done).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">In each WhatsApp group you are in, set your member tag as &quot;Name - Position&quot;, for example &quot;Maria - Sales&quot;, so everyone knows who you are and what you do.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="start-here-your-first-sign-in" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your first sign-in</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open the invitation email and press its link within 24 hours. Choose a password of 8 characters or more and press <b class="gd-ui">Save the new password</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-